>>
Rule 1 (approximate must be 'none' or 'tanh')
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = "none" ∨ v_2 = "tanh"
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must not be Char/int8)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 1
>>
Rule 3 (input tensor should be floating point)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 4 (tensor has valid non-negative dimension sizes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_1, i)
